  "body": "*With a Christmas special now available at Kamata Rise, this could be the opportunity you’ve been waiting for. Get in touch to find out what’s available and secure your new home for 2027.\r\n\r\nThere’s never been a better time to secure your place at Kamata Rise. With a special Christmas opportunity now available, Kamata Rise offers exceptional value for buyers looking to step into a brand-new home in Orewa’s growing Ara Hills community.\r\n\r\nBuilt by the reputable CETA Homes, these thoughtfully designed brick and weatherboard townhouses combine modern finishes, practical layouts and low-maintenance living. Whether you’re a first-home buyer, downsizer or investor, there are 2 and 3-bedroom options available to suit a range of needs.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n? 2 and 3-bedroom options available\r\n? Brick and weatherboard construction\r\n? 1 or 2 car parks, with garage options available\r\n? 10% deposit\r\n? Floor areas ranging from 77sqm to 132sqm\r\n? Choice of interior colour schemes\r\n? Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n? Construction well underway\r\n? Settlement estimated May 2027\r\n? Built by CETA Homes and backed by a Halo 10-Year Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nPositioned within Ara Hills, Kamata Rise is surrounded by native bush, green spaces and walking trails while remaining just minutes from Orewa town centre, schools, shops, cafés and Orewa Beach. Easy motorway access also keeps Auckland within convenient reach.",
